      "content": "Can you expand more on why you think Zone B would be more \"unstable\" than Zone C? You mentioned the Black demographic in B specifically as a factor for volatility/instability—is there a specific correlation there we should be accounting for in the report regarding neighborhood safety or long-term investment risk?",
